p('Common open items: native recordings and original mnemonic assets; final curated display; canonical bindings for plan-only vocabulary; explicit manager pointing discrepancy; written-letter sense of אות must remain distinct from sign/signal. These are identified authoring decisions, not permission to alter approved content silently.')
p('All ten current lessons: approval Pending; build Not started; verification in the actual course Not started. Readback checks of this document are recorded separately in the delivery receipt.')

if __name__=='__main__':
    data=dict(revision=1,date='2026-10-29',documentUrl=doc_url,status='Draft for Guy review',sourcePlan=plan_url,lessons=LESSONS,planned=[dict(id=r[0],position=i,title=r[1]) for i,r in enumerate(PLAN,1)],conventions=CONVENTIONS)
